<p>Using psionic forces you maintain in place on your back two giant horrific mechanical arms.</p><p>Each basic turn (as if you had 100% speed) they can automatically attack up to 2 foes within range 3 with a mindstar attack doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">91%, 104%, 114%, 122%, 130%</acronym> weapon damage.</p><p>Creatures harassed by the mechanical arms have their damage reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6%, 16%, 22%, 26%, 29%</acronym> for 5 turns.</p>